(FORBIDDEN ISLAND - Demo Rulebook \(Board Game Cafe\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(Forbidden Island is a cooperative game. Adventurers must capture four treasures from a) Tj T*
(sinking island and escape by helicopter from Fools' Landing.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SETUP) Tj T*
(Build the island with 24 tiles. Flood 6 tiles from the flood deck \(flip them to the) Tj T*
(blue side\). Each player gets a random adventurer role and 2 treasure cards. Set the) Tj T*
(water level as chosen.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(YOUR TURN) Tj T*
(1. Take up to 3 actions.) Tj T*
(2. Draw 2 treasure cards. A "Waters Rise!" card raises the water level and the flood) Tj T*
(   discard pile) Tj T*
(   is shuffled and put on top of the flood deck.) Tj T*
(3. Draw as many flood cards as the water level shows and flood those tiles. If a tile) Tj T*
(   is already) Tj T*
(   flooded, it sinks and is removed from the game.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ACTIONS) Tj T*
(- Move one tile up, down, left or right \(not diagonally\).) Tj T*
(- Shore up a flooded tile next to you or under you \(flip it back\).) Tj T*
(- Give a treasure card to a player on the same tile.) Tj T*
(- Capture a treasure: discard 4 matching treasure cards while standing on one of its) Tj T*
(   two tiles.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
