(SPECIAL CARDS) Tj T*
(Helicopter Lift moves one or more players on the same tile to any other tile. Sandbags) Tj T*
(shore up any tile. Both can be played at any time and do not cost an action. Hand) Tj T*
(limit: 5 cards.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ADVENTURERS) Tj T*
(- Pilot: once per turn, fly to any tile for 1 action.) Tj T*
(- Engineer: shore up 2 tiles for 1 action.) Tj T*
(- Explorer: may move and shore up diagonally.) Tj T*
(- Diver: may move through flooded and missing tiles.) Tj T*
(- Navigator: moves other players up to 2 tiles per action.) Tj T*
(- Messenger: may give treasure cards to a player anywhere.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SINKING WITH A PAWN) Tj T*
(If a tile sinks under a pawn, that player swims to an adjacent tile. If they cannot,) Tj T*
(the team loses.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(WINNING AND LOSING) Tj T*
(The team wins when all 4 treasures are captured, everyone is on Fools' Landing and a) Tj T*
(Helicopter Lift is played. The team loses if both tiles of an uncaptured treasure) Tj T*
(sink, if Fools' Landing sinks, if a player drowns, or if the water level reaches the) Tj T*
(skull.) Tj T*
ET
